TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="tests/**, test/**, **/*.test.ts, **/*.spec.ts"

TEST_COMMAND:
- pnpm test (Vitest or Jest — adjust to actual script)
- pnpm test:coverage for coverage report
- pnpm test --run for single non-watch pass

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- Test files co-located with source or in tests/ mirroring src/ layout
- Naming: foo.test.ts for unit, foo.spec.ts for integration (or project convention)
- One describe block per module, one it/test per behavior
- Test names are sentences: "returns null when input is empty"

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "no hard threshold; prefer integration over unit coverage")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real network calls without explicit integration test label
- No hardcoded ports or file paths — use tmp dirs and dynamic ports
- No skipped tests (it.skip) without a comment and a tracking issue
